    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep psychological horror set in the nihilistic world of Cotard Syndrome. Your critical decisions across four chapters determine which of seven unique endings you unlock. Every playthrough offers new discoveries and confrontations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Terror:</strong> Immerse yourself in the unsettling delusions of Cotard Syndrome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Chapters:</strong> Progress through increasingly intense, atmospheric scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Endings:</strong> Your choices directly shape who survives\u2014and how the story concludes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven Mechanics:</strong> Every decision branches the narrative in profound ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability:</strong> Experiment with different choices to uncover hidden details and endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your choices, face the void, and write your own reality in the emptiness of Cotard.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep psychological horror set in the nihilistic world of Cotard Syndrome. Your critical decisions across four chapters determine which of seven unique endings you unlock. Every playthrough offers new discoveries and confrontations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Terror:</strong> Immerse yourself in the unsettling delusions of Cotard Syndrome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Chapters:</strong> Progress through increasingly intense, atmospheric scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Endings:</strong> Your choices directly shape who survives\u2014and how the story concludes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven Mechanics:</strong> Every decision branches the narrative in profound ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability:</strong> Experiment with different choices to uncover hidden details and endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your choices, face the void, and write your own reality in the emptiness of Cotard.</p>",
